weather.mjs. hooks/bar.ts and hooks/register.tsx are new.

Changes from upstream:
- Everything on one line: the band never wraps onto a second row.
- No progress bars on the 5-hour and 7-day pills: label, percentage and time
  left only.
- The context pill keeps the weather icon and the token count; the per-prompt
  bars and the last-prompt trend moved to its hover card.
- The cost pill keeps the session total; what it means and what the last
  prompt added moved to a new hover card.
- New hover cards on the 5-hour and 7-day pills naming each limit, its share
  used and when it resets.
- A /bar command to choose which usage band shows above the prompt when
  several mods draw one.

